# =========================================================================
# .gitignore for the mwperm R package
# Goal: publish ONLY the installable R package (and standard dev scaffolding).
# Everything listed here is kept locally but NEVER pushed to GitHub -- this is
# what keeps sensitive / third-party / machine-local files out of every future
# `git add` + `git push`.
# =========================================================================

# ----- R build artifacts -----
*.tar.gz
*.Rcheck/
..Rcheck/
/*.Rout
src/*.o
src/*.so
src/*.dll
inst/doc/

# ----- R / RStudio machine-local state -----
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
.RData
.Ruserdata
.Rproj.user/

# ----- vignette / knitr build outputs -----
vignettes/*.html
vignettes/*.R
vignettes/*_cache/
vignettes/*_files/

# ----- OS / editor cruft -----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# ----- Claude Code project memory / local config (internal, not published) -----
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md

# ----- Internal design doc (not part of the shipped package) -----
IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md

# ----- Third-party reference material: the paper authors' replication code -----
# (MATLAB IPT_*.m, "Log of Gravity.xls", .mat/.RData, etc.) -- NOT ours to
# redistribute, so it is never committed/pushed.
shared code/

# ----- Local-only research code / write-ups (not part of the R package) -----
# simulation + benchmark scripts, generated results/figures, and the manuscript.
reference/
report/
